==Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{term|Srbija|Sr̀bija|Serbia|lang=hr}}.

===Proper noun===
{{infl|hr|proper noun|head=Srbijánac|g=m}}

# a [[Serbian]] (either a citizen of Serbia, or an ethnical Serb from Serbia)

====Usage notes====
{{term|Srbin|Sȑbin}} denotes an ethnical Serb, whilst {{term||Srbijánac}} denotes either a Serb from Serbia proper, or a citizen of Serbia regardless of his ethnicity.

====Related terms====
* {{l|hr|Srbijanka|Srbìjānka}}
* {{l|hr|Srbin|Sȑbin}}, {{l|hr|Srpkinja|Sȑpkinja}}

